  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1200\"></span> W heater is used to supply energy to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"240\"></span> grams of a substance. The graph shows how the temperature of the substance varies with time. The gradient of each non-horizontal segment of the graph is shown. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p> </p>\n<p>What is the best estimate for the specific heat capacity of the substance in the liquid state?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.2\"></span> kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> K<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.4\"></span> kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> K<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2.0\"></span> kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> K<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4.0\"></span> kJ kg<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span> K<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{-1}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
